saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'您的 AI 密钥已被某个插件的较新版本保存。请更新此插件，或在 AI 设置中重新输入密钥。','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'您保存的 AI 密钥已无法打开（该网站的安全密钥已更改）。请在 AI 设置中重新输入。','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'AI 尚未设置。请在 AI 设置中添加 AI 提供商的密钥。','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'未为此任务选择模型。请在 AI 设置中选择一个。','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'此版本的插件不支持该 AI 提供商。','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'未连接能够生成图像的 AI 提供商。请在 AI 设置中添加 OpenAI 或 Google Gemini 密钥。','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'此 AI 提供商无法生成图像。请在 AI 设置中选择 OpenAI 或 Google Gemini 以生成图像。','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'您的 AI 密钥无法使用任何图像模型。请向提供商检查密钥的权限，或为图像选择其他提供商。','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'没有已连接的 AI 提供商可以构建搜索索引。请在 AI 设置中添加 Google Gemini、OpenAI、Mistral 或 OpenRouter 密钥。','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'您的AI密钥无法使用任何嵌入模型。请向提供商检查密钥的权限，或为网站搜索选择其他提供商。','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'此 AI 提供商无法构建搜索索引。请连接 Google Gemini、OpenAI、Mistral 或兼容的服务以启用网站搜索。','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'此网站无法连接到您的 AI 服务。请检查该服务是否正在运行，以及您的网络服务器是否能够访问其地址（托管网站无法访问您自己计算机上的服务）。','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'此网站无法访问 %s。请检查其状态页面；如果服务器运行正常，则可能是您的主机屏蔽了外发连接，或者地址输入错误。','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s 表示您的账户已无可用额度或配额。请在其账户中添加额度或提高限制，然后重试。','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s 未接受您的密钥。它可能输入错误、已被吊销或已过期。请创建一个新密钥并将其粘贴在此处。','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s 拒绝了针对您的密钥的此请求。该密钥可能无法访问此模型或功能，或者您的账户需要验证。','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'您的密钥无法通过 %2$s 使用模型 "%1$s"。请在 AI 设置中选择另一个模型。','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'您的 %2$s 方案不包含模型 "%1$s"。请在 AI 设置中选择其他模型，或通过他们升级您的方案。','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s 正在限制您的密钥发送请求的速度。请稍候一分钟再试，或者提高您与他们的速率限制。','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s 目前遇到问题（对方服务器出现故障或过载）。您的设置没有问题。请稍后重试。','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'AI 请求因未知原因失败。请重试；如果问题仍然存在，请将以下详细信息提供给客服支持。','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'AI 提供商返回了此插件无法读取的格式。请重试；如果问题持续存在，请选择其他模型或联系支持人员。','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'自定义（兼容 OpenAI）','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'请先为该服务商保存一个密钥。','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'您的密钥有效，但提供商未列出可用的文本模型。请在下方自行添加模型。','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'已连接：%1$s 使用 %2$s 接听。您的人工智能功能已准备就绪。','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'您的用户角色不允许在本网站上使用人工智能。请联系管理员。','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'此网站已达到每月的 AI 消费限额。管理员可以在 AI 设置中提高限额。','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'本网站已达到每月的 AI 请求额度上限。管理员可以在 AI 设置中提高此额度。','Usage and cost'=>'使用量与费用','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'日志、限制和角色权限适用于通过以下方式使用的 AI：%s。','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'费用为大致估算，根据公开价格计算；没有已知价格的型号计为零。','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'本月：%1$s 个请求，约占 %2$s。','When'=>'当','Who'=>'谁','Used for'=>'用于','Model'=>'模型','Tokens in / out'=>'输入 / 输出','About'=>'关于','Result'=>'结果','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'尚未发起任何 AI 请求。','Done'=>'已完成','Limits and permissions'=>'限制与权限','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'每月支出限额（US dollars）','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'留空则表示不设限制。当大致费用达到该限额时，AI将在这个月的剩余时间内停止服务。','Monthly request limit'=>'每月请求数限制','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'留空则表示无限制。','Who may use AI'=>'谁可以使用人工智能','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'不勾选则允许所有能够使用该插件功能的人使用人工智能。管理员始终可以使用。','Save limits and permissions'=>'保存限制和权限','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'限制和权限已保存。','That language is not one of this site\'s languages.'=>'该语言不是本网站的语言之一。','A translation must be the same kind of content as the original.'=>'翻译必须与原文的内容类型保持一致。','Choose one of the site\'s other languages.'=>'选择该网站的其他语言之一。','Tranzly'=>'Tranzly','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'此插件副本中缺少管理屏幕的脚本。请从发布的程序包中重新安装。','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'此屏幕需要 JavaScript。','Choose a language'=>'选择语言','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'主机客户？立享 %2$s %1$d%% 的折扣','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'作为 Zinn Digital® 托管客户，您将获得一个个人代码，用于首次付款享 %d%% 的折扣。续费按正常价格收取。','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'获取我的 %d%% 优惠码并前往结账','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'此折扣适用于拥有付费且状态良好的托管计划的客户。免费试用不符合此资格。','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'您已经将针对此插件的托管客户折扣用过了。','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'我们刚才无法获取您的验证码。请在几分钟后重试。','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'前缀必须为 1 到 8 个小写字母或数字，以字母开头，且不能与插件名称相同。','"%s" is not a language code. Use a WordPress locale such as fr_FR or de_DE.'=>'"%s" 不是语言代码。请使用 WordPress 区域设置，例如 fr_FR 或 de_DE。','List at least one language.'=>'请列出至少一种语言。','Translations'=>'翻译','Edit the %s version'=>'编辑 %s 版本','Compare the %s version side by side'=>'并排比较 %s 版本','%1$s (%2$s)'=>'%1$s (%2$s)','Alternative text'=>'替代文本','Caption'=>'说明文字','Title'=>'标题','Choose one of your menus for each language.'=>'为每种语言选择一个菜单。','This is not a translation, so there is nothing to protect.'=>'这不是翻译，因此没有什么需要保护的。','This kind of content is not translated.'=>'此类内容不进行翻译。','Text %s is not on this site any more. Reload the page.'=>'文本 %s 已不在本网站上。请重新加载页面。','No translation engine could take this text.'=>'没有任何翻译引擎能够处理这段文本。','Choose one of your other languages.'=>'选择您的其他语言之一。','Compare translation'=>'比较翻译','You are not allowed to edit this translation.'=>'您无权编辑此翻译。','This is not a translation, so there is nothing to compare.'=>'这不是翻译，所以没有什么可比性。','The original of this translation no longer exists.'=>'本翻译的原文已不复存在。','Piece %s is not part of this translation any more. Reload the page and try again.'=>'片段 %s 已不再属于此翻译。请重新加载页面并重试。','This one'=>'这个','Translate again'=>'重新翻译','Translate'=>'翻译','Create a copy to translate by hand'=>'创建副本以进行人工翻译','Translate uses the engine set for that language. A version a person edited is never overwritten.'=>'翻译使用该语言设置的引擎。人工编辑过的版本绝不会被覆盖。','You are not allowed to translate this item.'=>'您无权翻译此项目。','%s: translated.'=>'%s：已翻译。','Translate on this page'=>'在此页面上翻译','This item already has a version in that language.'=>'该语言中已经存在此项目的一个版本。','That translation engine is not available on this site.'=>'此网站上无法使用该翻译引擎。','Different engines per language, automatic fallback and spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'不同语言使用不同翻译引擎、自动回退机制以及消费限额是 Tranzly Pro 功能。','Each language must be one of the site\'s languages, with an available engine.'=>'每种语言必须是该网站的语言之一，并且必须配备可用的引擎。','The fallback list may only name available engines.'=>'备用列表只能包含可用的引擎。','A monthly cap is an amount in US dollars, zero or more, for an available engine.'=>'可用引擎的每月上限是可用引擎的一个 US 元金额，可以为零或大于零。','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features. The do-not-translate list is free.'=>'针对每种语言的偏好翻译和语气功能属于 Tranzly Pro 专业版功能。禁止翻译列表则是免费的。','Glossary entries must be grouped by one of the site\'s languages.'=>'术语表条目必须按网站的一种语言进行分组。','Tone is set per site language: formality default, more or less, plus optional instructions.'=>'语气按网站语言设置：默认正式程度（程度略有不同），外加可选指令。','The value for %s is not one of the allowed choices.'=>'%s 的值不在允许的选择范围内。','The background queue is not available on this site.'=>'此网站当前无法使用后台队列。','A translation job runs as the person who starts it, so a user must be signed in.'=>'翻译作业将以启动它的用户的身份运行，因此用户必须处于登录状态。','There is nothing you are allowed to translate in that selection.'=>'选定的内容中没有任何您可以翻译的文本。','That item is not part of a translation job.'=>'该项目不属于任何翻译任务。','You are not allowed to change that translation.'=>'您无权更改该翻译。','This item\'s group already has a %1$s version (#%2$d).'=>'此项目的分组已存在一个 %1$s 版本 (#%2$d)。','An item cannot be its own translation.'=>'一项不能是其自身的翻译。','That item is already a translation of something else. Unlink it first.'=>'该项目已经是其他内容的翻译。请先取消链接。','The translation link could not be saved.'=>'无法保存翻译链接。','That text cannot be translated here.'=>'无法在此处翻译该文本。','That media text cannot be translated here.'=>'该媒体文本无法在此处翻译。','A translation can be published or kept as a draft.'=>'翻译可以发布或保留为草稿。','You are not allowed to publish this kind of content.'=>'您无权发布此类内容。','This item is already written in that language.'=>'该项目已经使用该语言编写。','This translation was edited by a person (or imported), so it is protected. Unlock it to translate it again.'=>'此翻译由人工编辑（或导入），因此已被保护。解锁后方可重新翻译。','That item does not exist.'=>'该项目不存在。','No translation engine is set up yet. Add a key for one in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'尚未设置翻译引擎。请在 Tranzly → 引擎中添加一个密钥。','That translation engine is not set up yet: add its key first.'=>'该翻译引擎尚未配置：请先添加其密钥。','The same text is being translated by another job right now; this item will use that answer.'=>'另一个翻译任务目前正在翻译相同的文本；此项目将使用该翻译结果。','No translation engine could take this item.'=>'没有任何翻译引擎可以处理此项。','The engine did not return a translation for every part of this item. Nothing was changed.'=>'引擎未返回此项目各个部分的翻译。未作任何更改。','AI model'=>'AI 模型','AI model (%1$s %2$s)'=>'AI 模型 (%1$s %2$s)','%s is having problems right now. Try again shortly, or use another engine.'=>'%s 当前遇到问题。请稍后重试，或使用其他引擎。','Your site could not reach %s. Check that it can make outgoing connections, then try again.'=>'您的网站无法连接到 %s。请检查其是否能够建立传出连接，然后重试。','%s did not accept your API key. Check the key in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'%s 未接受您的 API 密钥。请检查 Tranzly → Engines 中的密钥。','Your %s account has used up its quota or balance. Top it up with them, or use another engine.'=>'您的 %s 账户已用完配额或余额。请通过他们进行充值，或使用其他引擎。','%s asked us to slow down. It will be tried again automatically.'=>'%s 请求我们降低速度。系统将自动重试。','This text is too long for %s in one go. Split the content, or use another engine.'=>'这段文本对于 %s 来说一次性过长。请拆分内容，或使用其他引擎。','%s refused to translate this content. Try another engine, or translate it by hand.'=>'%s 拒绝翻译此内容。请尝试其他引擎，或手动进行翻译。','%s does not tr