is order'=>'如果引擎失效或达到限制，请按以下顺序依次尝试：','Monthly spending caps'=>'每月消费上限','When an engine reaches its cap, nothing more is sent to it until next month and the failed-translation report says why. Leave empty for no cap.'=>'当引擎达到其上限时，直到下个月才会向其发送更多内容，且翻译失败报告会说明原因。留空则表示不设上限。','%1$s (spent this month: $%2$s)'=>'%1$s（本月已消费：$%2$s）','Save caps'=>'保存大写字母','Glossary and words never translated'=>'术语表与永不翻译的词汇','Never translate these words (one per line)'=>'永不翻译这些词（每行一个）','Brand and product names stay exactly as they are, with every engine.'=>'品牌和产品名称在所有引擎中都保持原样。','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'首选翻译和每种语言的语调是 Tranzly Pro 的功能。','Preferred translations (one per line: term = translation)'=>'首选翻译（每行一个：术语 = 翻译）','Formality'=>'正式程度','Default'=>'默认','Formal'=>'正式','Informal'=>'非正式','Style instructions (audience, brand voice)'=>'风格说明（受众、品牌语调）','Save glossary'=>'保存词汇表','Settings'=>'设置','Translation engine'=>'翻译引擎','What Tranzly translates on this site'=>'Tranzly 在本网站上翻译的内容','found, translated with your content'=>'已找到，并根据您的内容进行了翻译','not on this site'=>'不在本网站上','With Tranzly Pro: Elementor, Bricks, Divi, Beaver Builder, Oxygen and WPBakery pages; everything in WooCommerce, with prices in the visitor’s currency; the SEO fields of Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress and All in One SEO; ACF, Meta Box and Pods fields; forms and their e-mails; your theme’s and plugins’ own text; and comments and reviews.'=>'使用 Tranzly Pro：Elementor、Bricks、Divi、Beaver Builder、Oxygen 和 WPBakery 页面；WooCommerce 中的所有内容，并以访问者的货币显示价格；Yoast SEO、Rank Math、SEOPress 和 All in One SEO 的 SEO 字段；ACF、Meta Box 和 Pods 字段；表单及其电子邮件；您的主题和插件自身的文本；以及评论和评价。','Shop text and e-mails'=>'商店文本与电子邮件','E-mail subjects and headings, payment and shipping method names, and the checkout notices. Each order’s e-mails go out in the language it was placed in.'=>'电子邮件主题和标题、支付与配送方式名称以及结账通知。每个订单的电子邮件都会使用下单时的语言发送。','Forms and their e-mails'=>'表单及其电子邮件','Every form keeps one list of entries; its labels, buttons, messag