age.'=>'任务已开始，共有 %d 个翻译待处理。任务在后台运行，您可以关闭此页面。','Queued again.'=>'已重新加入队列。','Running'=>'运行中','Finished'=>'已完成','Set up a translation engine in the Engines tab first.'=>'请先在“引擎”标签页中设置翻译引擎。','Translate every'=>'全部翻译','Into'=>'导入','With'=>'带有','Each language’s own engine'=>'每种语言专属的引擎','Publish the translations (otherwise they are saved as drafts)'=>'发布翻译（否则它们将另存为草稿）','Estimate the cost'=>'估算费用','%1$d posts, %2$s characters. The price for this engine is not known in advance.'=>'%1$d 篇帖子，%2$s 个字符。此引擎的价格未知。','%1$d posts, %2$s characters: about $%3$s on your own account.'=>'%1$d 篇文章，%2$s 个字符：您的账户大约需要 $%3$s。','Start translating'=>'开始翻译','Jobs'=>'任务','No translation jobs yet.'=>'暂无翻译任务。','Job %1$d — %2$s'=>'作业 %1$d — %2$s','%1$d of %2$d translated, %3$d failed, %4$d skipped (protected or already in that language)'=>'已翻译 %1$d / %2$d，失败 %3$d，已跳过 %4$d（受保护或已是该语言）','Stop this job'=>'停止此作业','See what failed and why'=>'查看失败的项目及原因','Content'=>'内容','Language'=>'语言','What went wrong'=>'哪里出错了','Fix it'=>'修复','Retry with'=>'重试：','The same engine'=>'同一引擎','Retry'=>'重试','Translate by hand'=>'手动翻译','Menus saved.'=>'已保存菜单。','%d texts translated.'=>'已翻译 %d 个文本。','Saved. Your corrections are protected from machine translation.'=>'已保存。您的更正已受到保护，免受机器翻译影响。','The same menu, translated'=>'已翻译的相同菜单','A separate menu per language'=>'每种语言一个独立菜单','By default each menu is translated: its links lead to the translated pages, with their titles. Choose a menu of its own for a language here instead.'=>'默认情况下，每个菜单都会被翻译：其链接会指向带有对应标题的已翻译页面。您也可以在此处为特定语言单独选择一个菜单。','Shared text'=>'共享文本','Which text'=>'哪个文本','Menu labels'=>'菜单标签','Site title, tagline and widgets'=>'网站标题、标语和小部件','Templates, headers, footers and patterns'=>'模板、页眉、页脚和模式','Translate the missing text'=>'翻译缺失的文本','There is no text to translate here.'=>'此处没有要翻译的文本。','Corrected by a person, protected'=>'人工校对，已保护','Save corrections'=>'保存修改','Languages and settings'=>'语言与设置','Engines'=>'引擎','Translation jobs'=>'翻译任务','Addresses and SEO'=>'地址与SEO','Language switchers'=>'语言切换器','SEO audit'=>'SEO 审计','Menus and shared text'=>'菜单与共享文本','Translation status'=>'翻译状态','Integrations'=>'集成','No meta description'=>'无元描述','A language version visitors cannot open (draft, private or password)'=>'访客无法打开的语言版本（草稿、私密或受密码保护）','The address still uses the original words'=>'该地址仍在使用原来的字词','Still holds the original text'=>'仍然保留原文本','The multilingual SEO audit is part of Tranzly Pro. It finds missing meta descriptions, broken hreflang, untranslated addresses and duplicate content, per language.'=>'多语言 SEO 审计是 Tranzly Pro 的一部分。它能按语言查找缺失的元描述、损坏的 hreflang、未翻译的地址和重复内容。','Language to audit'=>'待审核语言','Run the audit'=>'运行审计','Check the next pages'=>'查看下一页','%1$d pages checked, %2$d problems found.'=>'已检查 %1$d 个页面，发现 %2$d 个问题。','The whole language has been checked.'=>'整个语言已通过检查。','Page'=>'页面','Problem'=>'问题','Edit'=>'编辑','Job %1$d started: %2$d pages are being translated in the background. Follow it in Translation jobs.'=>'任务 %1$d 已开始：正在后台翻译 %2$d 个页面。请在“翻译任务”中查看进度。','%d translations are being checked in the background. Scores appear here as they arrive.'=>'正正在后台检查 %d 个翻译。分数随之显示在这里。','Missing'=>'缺失','Out of date'=>'过期','Translated'=>'已翻译','Edited by a person'=>'由人工编辑','Machine translated'=>'机器翻译','Waiting for review'=>'等待审核','Needs a human look'=>'需要人工审核','Everything'=>'全部','Up to date'=>'已是最新版本','Tranzly is still working out which older translations are out of date. The "out of date" numbers will grow while it does.'=>'Tranzly 仍在计算哪些旧翻译已过时。在此期间，“已过时”的数量将会增加。','Content type'=>'内容类型','All content'=>'所有内容','Average quality'=>'平均质量','%1$d translated (%2$d%%)'=>'已翻译 %1$d 个（%2$d%%）','Show'=>'显示','Translate everything missing'=>'翻译所有未完成的内容','Update everything out of date'=>'更新所有过时的项目','Check the quality with AI'=>'使用 AI 检查质量','Translate the low-scoring pages again'=>'重新翻译低分页面','Nothing here.'=>'这里什么都没有。','Quality'=>'质量','by a person'=>'由个人','waiting for review'=>'等待审核','Side by side'=>'并排','Show more'=>'显示更多','Bulk translate the whole site (Pro)'=>'批量翻译整个网站 (Pro)','With Tranzly Pro, choose content types and languages, see the estimate, and translate the whole site in one go.'=>'使用 Tranzly Pro，选择内容类型和语言，查看预估费用，即可一键翻译整个网站。','%d background jobs started, one per language. Follow them in Translation jobs.'=>'已启动 %d 个后台任务（每种语言一个）。请在“翻译任务”中查看其进度。','Content types'=>'内容类型','What to translate'=>'要翻译的内容','Only what is missing'=>'仅缺少的项目','Only what is out of date'=>'仅限过期的内容','Everything (pages edited by a person stay as they are)'=>'所有内容（由人工编辑的页面将保持不变）','Estimate'=>'预估','%1$d pages, %2$s characters. This engine does not publish a price.'=>'%1$d 页，%2$s 个字符。此引擎未发布价格。','%1$d pages, %2$s characters, about $%3$s.'=>'%1$d 页，%2$s 个字符，约 $%3$s。','Find a text'=>'查找文本','%d more: type in "Find a text" to narrow the list.'=>'还有 %d 个：请输入“查找文本”以缩减列表。','A small button in a corner of every page, on any theme, with no set-up.'=>'每个页面角落的小巧按钮，适配任意主题，无需进行任何设置。','Off'=>'关闭','Bottom corner, end side'=>'底角、末端侧','Bottom corner, start side'=>'起始侧底角','Top corner, end side'=>'顶部角，末端侧','Top corner, start side'=>'顶部角，起始侧','Switcher around the content'=>'内容切换器','Add a switcher to every post and page'=>'为每篇博文和页面添加切换器','Before the content'=>'内容之前','After the content'=>'内容发布后','Other ways to add a switcher'=>'其他添加切换器的方法','Block editor and site editor: the “Language switcher” block, with five designs.'=>'区块编辑器和站点编辑器：“语言切换器”区块，提供五种设计。','Page Builder Sandwich: the “Language switcher” element.'=>'Page Builder Sandwich：“语言切换器”元素。','Menus: Appearance → Menus → “Language switcher” box.'=>'菜单：外观 → 菜单 → “语言切换器”方框。','Sidebars: the “Language switcher” widget.'=>'边栏：“语言切换器”小部件。','Anywhere else, the shortcode:'=>'在其他地方，简码：','Elementor and Bricks: the “Language switcher” widget in each builder.'=>'Elementor 和 Bricks：每个构建器中的“语言切换器”小部件。','Elementor and Bricks widgets are part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Elementor 和 Bricks 小部件是 Tranzly Pro 的一部分。','Save'=>'保存','A folder per language: example.com/de/'=>'每种语言一个文件夹：example.com/de/','A subdomain per language: de.example.com'=>'每种语言一个子域：de.example.com','A separate domain per language: example.de'=>'每个语言使用独立域名：example.de','A query parameter: example.com/?lang=de (older sites)'=>'查询参数：example.com/?lang=de（旧版网站）','Category'=>'类别','Tag'=>'标签','Product'=>'产品','Product category'=>'产品类别','Product tag'=>'产品标签','Saved. Your language addresses have changed as shown below.'=>'已保存。您的语言地址已更改，如下所示。','Language in the address'=>'地址栏中的语言','How visitors and search engines reach each language'=>'访客和搜索引擎如何访问每种语言','Address word for %s'=>'%s 的寻址字','The default language has no word in its addresses.'=>'默认语言的地址中没有字词。','Domain for %s (optional)'=>'%s 的域名（可选）','Point the domain at this site first. A language with no domain uses a folder on your main domain.'=>'请先将域名指向此网站。没有域名的语言将使用主域名上的文件夹。','Where each language lives now'=>'各个语言目前的位置','Translated address words'=>'已翻译的地址字词','Page and post addresses come from their translated titles. Here you translate the fixed words, so /de/kategorie/ replaces /de/category/.'=>'页面和文章地址来自于其翻译后的标题。在此处您可翻译固定词汇，例如用 /de/kategorie/ 替换 /de/category/。','%1$s (now “%2$s”)'=>'%1$s（现为“%2$s”）','Search engines and visitors'=>'搜索引擎和访客','Offer visitors their own language with a small banner (never a redirect)'=>'通过醒目的横幅（绝不使用重定向）为访客提供他们自己的语言','Hide untranslated pages from search engines (noindex)'=>'将未翻译的页面从搜索引擎中隐藏 (noindex)','A translation that still holds the original text is kept out of search results until it is translated.'=>'包含原文的译文在翻译完成之前将不会显示在搜索结果中。','Part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Tranzly Pro 的一部分。','Tranzly adds hreflang links (with x-default), the page language and direction, and every language to your sitemap:'=>'Tranzly 会为您的网站地图添加 hreflang 链接（包含 x-default）、页面语言和方向，以及所有语言：','Working together with: %s.'=>'与 %s 合作。','Each address word is 2 to 12 lowercase letters, digits or hyphens.'=>'每个地址字词应包含 2 到 12 个小写字母、数字或连字符。','Auto-translate on update, reviewer roles, XLIFF export for translators, switching from WPML, Polylang or TranslatePress and the AI quality check come with Tranzly Pro.'=>'Tranzly Pro 包含更新时自动翻译、审阅者角色、面向翻译人员的 XLIFF 导出、从 WPML、Polylang 或 TranslatePress 切换以及 AI 质量检查。','When an original changes'=>'当原件更改时','When a page is edited'=>'当页面被编辑时','Mark its translations out of date'=>'将翻译标记为过期','Translate its translations again in the background'=>'在后台重新翻译其翻译内容','Do nothing'=>'什么也不做','A translation a person edited is never overwritten; it is marked out of date instead.'=>'人工编辑过的翻译绝不会被覆盖；相反，它会被标记为过期。','Translate new pages into every language when they are published'=>'在发布新页面时将其翻译成所有语言','A second AI model reads each translation beside its original, scores it and names the mistakes. It uses your own AI key from the AI settings. Start a check from Translation status.'=>'第二个 AI 模型会在原文旁边逐一阅读每个译文，为其评分并指出错误。它会使用你在 AI 设置中配置的 AI 密钥。从“翻译状态”开始检查。','AI provider'=>'AI 提供商','The AI settings’ general model'=>'AI 设置的通用模型','Recommended'=>'推荐','A page needs a human look below this score'=>'低于此分数的内容需要人工审核','Publish only translations a reviewer approved'=>'仅发布经审核人员批准的翻译','Give people the Translator role (edits translations, never the originals, cannot publish) or the Translation reviewer role (also approves). Reviewers also find everything waiting in the Posts and Pages lists under “Pending”; publishing one there approves it.'=>'授予用户“翻译”角色（可编辑译文，但无法编辑原文，也无法发布）或“翻译审核”角色（同时可进行批准）。审核者还可以在“文章”和“页面”列表的“待审核”栏目下找到所有等待处理的内容；在其中发布内容即表示对其进行批准。','Manage users'=>'管理用户','Nothing is waiting for review.'=>'当前没有等待审核的内容。','Note for the translator (optional)'=>'译者备注（可选）','Read side by side'=>'并排阅读','Approve'=>'批准','Ask for changes'=>'申请更改','%d translations imported and protected from machine translation.'=>'已导入 %d 个翻译并防止机器翻译。','Export and import for translators'=>'译者导出与导入','Not translated yet'=>'尚未翻译','Already translated'=>'已翻译','Format'=>'格式','XLIFF 1.2 (translation tools)'=>'XLIFF 1.2（翻译工具）','CSV (spreadsheets)'=>'CSV（电子表格）','Download the file'=>'下载文件','Import a translated file'=>'导入已翻译的文件','Undone: %1$d links removed, %2$d imported pages deleted.'=>'已撤销：移除了 %1$d 个链接，删除了 %2$d 个导入的页面。','Dry run, nothing changed:'=>'模拟运行，未作更改：','Imported:'=>'已导入：','%1$d languages added, %2$d translations linked, %3$d pages built, %4$d texts.'=>'已添加 %1$d 种语言，已链接 %2$d 个翻译，已生成 %3$d 个页面，%4$d 条文本。','Switch the other plugin off first (its addresses and switchers would fight Tranzly). Its data stays where it is, so you can switch back; Undo removes exactly what the import added.'=>'请先关闭其他插件（它们的地址和切换器会与 Tranzly 冲突）。其数据将保留在原地，因此您可以随时切换回来；“撤销”操作会精准移除导入的内容。','No data from this plugin on this site.'=>'此网站上没有来自该插件的数据。','Languages: %s'=>'语言：%s','still active: switch it off first.'=>'仍然处于活动状态：请先将其关闭。','Dry run'=>'模拟运行','Import'=>'导入','Undo the import'=>'撤销导入','Comments and product reviews'=>'评论与产品评价','Each language keeps its own'=>'每种语言都保留其自身的','Show every language’s comments on every version'=>'显示所有版本中每种语言的评论','Show them all, translated into the reader’s language'=>'显示全部内容，并将其翻译成读者的语言','Translating uses your translation engine for every approved comment. Spam and comments waiting for moderation are never sent.'=>'翻译功能会为每个已批准的评论调用您的翻译引擎。垃圾评论和等待审核的评论绝不会被发送。','Saved. The pieces you changed are marked as checked by a person, and this translation is protected from machine translation.'=>'已保存。您修改的部分已被标记为经人工核对，此翻译已受到保护，免受机器翻译影响。','The layout of this translation was changed in the editor, so some pieces no longer pair with the original. Pieces without a partner are shown empty; edit the rest in the editor.'=>'此翻译的布局已在编辑器中更改，因此某些部分不再与原文配对。没有配对的部分将显示为空白；请在编辑器中编辑其余部分。','Open the editor'=>'打开编辑器','Original (%s)'=>'原版 (%s)','Translation (%s)'=>'翻译 (%s)','Save changes'=>'保存更改','Open in the editor'=>'在编辑器中打开','Checked by a person'=>'人工检查','Imported'=>'已导入','Not in the translation'=>'不在翻译中','Add a second language under Tranzly in the admin menu, and the switcher appears here.'=>'在管理菜单的 Tranzly 下添加第二种语言，切换器就会显示在这里。','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'默认关闭：国旗代表国家，而非语言。','What screen readers announce, for example “Choose a language”.'=>'屏幕阅读器的朗读内容，例如“选择语言”。','Colours'=>'颜色','Not translated'=>'未翻译','Original'=>'原始','Published'=>'已发布','Draft'=>'草稿','Checked by a person, protected'=>'人工审核，安全保障','Imported, protected'=>'已导入，受保护','Not translated yet (a copy)'=>'尚未翻译（副本）','Save this post first, then translate it here.'=>'请先保存此文章，然后再在此处进行翻译。','View'=>'查看','Unlock so it can be translated again'=>'解锁以便再次翻译','Protect'=>'保护','Publish the translations'=>'发布翻译','Translate into %d language'=>'翻译成 %d 种语言','Show this block'=>'显示此区块','In every language'=>'在每种语言中','Only in the languages ticked'=>'仅在勾选的语言中','In every language except those ticked'=>'除勾选的语言外，所有语言','Image per language'=>'多语言图片','Show another image to readers of a language, for example a banner with words on it.'=>'向使用特定语言的读者展示另一张图片，例如带有文字的横幅。','Replace the %s image'=>'替换 %s 图像','Choose a %s image'=>'选择 %s 镜像','Use the original image'=>'使用原图','Correct this translation'=>'校正此翻译','Saving…'=>'正在保存…','Translated text. Press Enter to correct it.'=>'已翻译文本。按回车键进行修改。','Click any outlined text to correct its translation.'=>'点击任何带有轮廓的文本以纠正其翻译。','No translated text was found on this page to edit here. Use the side-by-side editor instead.'=>'在此页面上未找到可在此编辑的翻译文本。请改用并排编辑器。','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'语言切换器','block descriptionLinks to this page in each of the site\'s languages. It renders nothing until two or more languages are listed.'=>'指向该网站各个语言版本的此页链接。在列出两个或更多语言之前，它不呈现任何内容。','block keywordlanguage'=>'语言','block keywordswitcher'=>'切换器','block keywordtranslation'=>'翻译','block descriptionLets visitors read this page in another of your languages: a list, pills, buttons, a dropdown or language codes, with optional flags.'=>'让访客以您的另一种语言阅读此页面：列表、胶囊按钮、按钮、下拉菜单或语言代码，并可选配旗帜图标。','block keywordmultilingual'=>'多语言']];